    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in, stack the shelves, survive the night.</strong> Step behind the counter of <i>Reel Evil Video</i>, a cursed 90s horror store where your dead-end retail job has become a waking nightmare. Serve demanding customers by day, battling to meet impossible sales targets. At night, face unspeakable horrors stalking the aisles. Trapped in a cycle of endless shifts and supernatural torment, you must hit your targets... or become trapped behind the counter for eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1739f0d979c31e6feb66020cf6455d73.poster.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1739f0d979c31e6feb66020cf6455d73.webm?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1739f0d979c31e6feb66020cf6455d73.mp4?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/54b78f4d244fe243ad5dd92dd790f685.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock the shelves, serve the crowds, and keep the horror fans happy. Fill your aisles with cursed tapes, creepy decor, and rare cult classics to boost your sales and hit your daily targets. But the better the store runs, the deeper the darkness grows behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/a2c4aae86d0a335c4fc45b30df980412.poster.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/a2c4aae86d0a335c4fc45b30df980412.webm?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/a2c4aae86d0a335c4fc45b30df980412.mp4?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/ba806b569c61b44b38b8aa63133cd6e0.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare and forbidden tapes hidden deep in the aisles\u2014twisted cult classics, lost recordings, and cursed reels no customer should ever see. Some unlock new powers to help you survive the night. Others open doorways to stranger worlds, where reality breaks down and your nightmares take control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/531d2907cb77e6fdc5193e0861c3f249.poster.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/531d2907cb77e6fdc5193e0861c3f249.webm?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/531d2907cb77e6fdc5193e0861c3f249.mp4?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1a3ba8443207af1554e5dbac45ec99ab.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As each shift ends and the light becomes dark, the horrors of the tapes are unleashed. You\u2019ll need to stay quiet, think fast, and use whatever you can find to outlast what\u2019s hunting you. Some nights you\u2019ll hide. Some nights you\u2019ll run. And some nights... you\u2019ll have no choice but to face what\u2019s waiting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/26ad6387e5faa0bca6c471483fdfda59.poster.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/26ad6387e5faa0bca6c471483fdfda59.webm?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/26ad6387e5faa0bca6c471483fdfda59.mp4?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clock in, stack the shelves, survive the night.</strong> Step behind the counter of <i>Reel Evil Video</i>, a cursed 90s horror store where your dead-end retail job has become a waking nightmare. Serve demanding customers by day, battling to meet impossible sales targets. At night, face unspeakable horrors stalking the aisles. Trapped in a cycle of endless shifts and supernatural torment, you must hit your targets... or become trapped behind the counter for eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1739f0d979c31e6feb66020cf6455d73.poster.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1739f0d979c31e6feb66020cf6455d73.webm?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/1739f0d979c31e6feb66020cf6455d73.mp4?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/54b78f4d244fe243ad5dd92dd790f685.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=59 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stock the shelves, serve the crowds, and keep the horror fans happy. Fill your aisles with cursed tapes, creepy decor, and rare cult classics to boost your sales and hit your daily targets. But the better the store runs, the deeper the darkness grows behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/a2c4