ark, the horrors of the tapes are unleashed. You\u2019ll need to stay quiet, think fast, and use whatever you can find to outlast what\u2019s hunting you. Some nights you\u2019ll hide. Some nights you\u2019ll run. And some nights... you\u2019ll have no choice but to face what\u2019s waiting in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/26ad6387e5faa0bca6c471483fdfda59.poster.avif?t=1752263624\" width=610 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/26ad6387e5faa0bca6c471483fdfda59.webm?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3873210/extras/26ad6387e5faa0bca6c471483fdfda59.mp4?t=1752263624\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
